          "fill": "$yellow-fg",
          "content": "改善案B — 週次・月次レポート案内",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PBomn",
          "name": "意図1",
          "fill": "$foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1. レポート示唆の入口は今日に置くが、今日の主問（いま向き合う判断）を奪わない。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UooWZ",
          "name": "意図2",
          "fill": "$foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2. 強さは弱: 薄い帯＋テキストリンクのみ。概観抜粋や主役ボタンは出さない。未読がある月曜〜火曜朝／月初数日だけ。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pvUaj",
          "name": "意図3",
          "fill": "$foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3. 個人のKPT・学びは副導線。レポートにEM個人データを詰め込まない（retrospective改善案と整合）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gcyuq",
          "name": "意図4",
          "fill": "$foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. 月曜と月初が重なる週は、週次帯を主・月次はさらに短い併記リンク（同時にヒーローを立てない）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
